-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\"Dated snapshot; no env fallback.\"),\n  row(\"system prompt\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:14\",\"COPY --chown=0:0 prompts/ prompts/\",\"Prompt baked into digest-pinned image.\"),\n  row(\"python dependencies\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:6\",\"RUN pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: --target /deps -r requirements.txt\",\"Hash-pinned install.\")])\nno(\"C03.2\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:41\",'- imageReferences: [\"registry.acme.example/people/hr-helpdesk-agent*\"]',\n \"The only outside check is Kyverno admission, which verifies image signature and provenance at pod creation. Nothing outside the agent observes the running prompt, model or tool setup and compares it with the manifest. The only comparison is the agent's own start-up check at src/main.py:46, which uses IMAGE_DIGEST taken from its own environment, not observed.\")\nyes(\"C03.3\",\"src/main.py:46\",'AGENT_TYPE_ID = type_id.verify_or_exit(os.environ[\"AGENT_TYPE_ID\"], os.environ[\"IMAGE_DIGEST\"], type_id.model_record(CFG))',\n \"Looked for a constant or env-only ID. The env value is only the expected ID; verify_or_exit returns the computed value (type_id.py:57) and that is what main.py:50 and audit emit. No try/except around main.py:46.\",\n \"Emitted ID is the hash of files read at start plus image digest and model record.\",\n [row(\"files under src/ prompts/ config/\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:28\",\"for p in sorted((ROOT / d).rglob(\\\"*\\\")):\",\"All files hashed as raw bytes; includes config/tools.yaml (tool setup).\"),\n  row(\"requirements.txt and Dockerfile\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:31\",\"for f in INPUT_FILES:\",\"Hashed.\"),\n  row(\"model record\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:49\",'return {\"provider\": m[\"provider\"], \"id\": m[\"id\"], \"pinning\": m[\"pinning\"], \"adapter\": m[\"adapter\"]}',\"Model identity from the loaded config.\"),\n  row(\"image digest\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:42\",'manifest = {\"scheme\": HASH_SCHEME, \"image_digest\": image_digest,',\"Digest included (value comes from env).\"),\n  row(\"emitted ID returned as computed value\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:57\",\"return actual\",\"Returned value is computed, not env.\"),\n  row(\"emission to telemetry\",\"enforced\",\"src/main.py:50\",'\"gen_ai.agent.id\": AGENT_TYPE_ID','Span resource uses computed ID.'),\n  row(\"emission to audit\",\"enforced\",\"src/main.py:79\",\"agent_type_id=AGENT_TYPE_ID\",\"Audit context uses computed ID.\"),\n  row(\"gateway entrypoint\",\"not_applicable\",\"src/gateway.py:135\",\"agent_type_id_hint, agent_instance_hint, subject, actor, tool, decision, reason, policy_version)\",\"Gateway only records a caller-sent hint; it does not emit its own ID.\")])\nyes(\"C03.4\",\"config/agent.yaml:12\",\"  adapter: none\",\n \"Searched repo for from_pretrained, torch.load, safetensors, weights downloads: none. Only hosted Anthropic API (agent.py:70).\",\n \"Only a hosted model is used; no self-hosted weights or adapters.\",\n [row(\"self-hosted weights and adapters load paths\",\"not_applicable\",\"config/agent.yaml:12\",\"  adapter: none\",\"Hosted provider only; manifest says fine_tune none.\"),\n  row(\"model call site I7727b50a21\",\"not_applicable\",\"src/agent.py:70\",\"resp = await self.llm.messages.create(\",\"Hosted API call.\")])\nyes(\"C03.5\",\"src/type_id.py:56\",\"        sys.exit(78)\",\n \"Looked for try/except or log-only handling around verify_or_exit; none at main.py:46. Missing env raises KeyError and invalid digest raises ValueError, both stop import.\",\n \"Mismatch exits the process; admission denies unsigned images.\",\n [row(\"agent type-id mismatch\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:56\",\"sys.exit(78)\",\"Process exits non-zero.\"),\n  row(\"check error path\",\"enforced\",\"src/type_id.py:38\",'raise ValueError(\"image digest must be sha256:<64 hex>\")',\"Error stops start-up, no fallback.\"),\n  row(\"image signature mismatch at admission\",\"enforced\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:19\",\"validationFailureAction: Enforce\",\"Pod denied.\"),\n  row(\"admission webhook failure\",\"enforced\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:20\",\"failurePolicy: Fail\",\"Fails closed.\")])\nans(\"item\",\"C03\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"Only the agent checks its own identity at start-up; no process outside it compares the running prompt, model and tool setup to the approved manifest.\",\n next=\"Add an external check, such as an admission rule or scheduled job, that compares observed pod artifacts with release/manifest.yaml.\",\n violates=\"Check the running setup against the approved manifest\")\n\n# ---- C04\nno(\"C04.1\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:22\",\"  background: false\",\n \"Kyverno policy checks only image source, signature and provenance at admission and has background scanning off. No job compares harness settings, prompts, MCP server lists, permissions or network policies with a baseline.\")\nno(\"C04.2\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:22\",\"  background: false\",\n \"No schedule or controller re-checks deployments; the only schedule in the repo is audit partition maintenance (k8s/audit-maintenance.yaml:8). Deploy is a one-shot kubectl apply.\")\nno(\"C04.3\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:19\",\"validationFailureAction: Enforce\",\n \"Enforce denies an unsigned image at creation only. No drift alert, configured response (block, quarantine, rollback) or time limit exists for other drift.\")\nans(\"item\",\"C04\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"No drift check compares running prompts, tools, permissions or network policy with the approved baseline.\",\n next=\"Add a scheduled per-deployment drift job with alert, response and time limit set in config.\",\n violates=\"Compare running images, harness settings, prompts, MCP server lists, permissions, network policies, and self-hosted model weights against their approved baseline\")\n\n# ---- C05\nRQ=\"anthropic==0.69.0 --hash=sha256:195b8cacfef3d1c6a675b88ef39969ce8973f93c8ced6423dfe0d12ef8307cce\"\nyes(\"C05.1\",\"requirements.txt:2\",RQ,\n \"Searched requirements.txt for ^ ~ >= * and unpinned lines; none. Searched Dockerfile and workflow for pip installs outside the hashed file; none. No requirements.in or other lockfile is present.\",\n \"All dependencies are exact versions with hashes; installs require hashes.\",\n [row(\"requirements.txt entries (13 packages)\",\"enforced\",\"requirements.txt:2\",RQ,\"Each line uses == and --hash; lines 2-14.\"),\n  row(\"Dockerfile pip install\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:6\",\"RUN pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: --target /deps -r requirements.txt\",\"Hashes required.\"),\n  row(\"CI pip install\",\"enforced\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:28\",\"- run: pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.txt\",\"Hashes required.\"),\n  row(\"Dockerfile FROM lines\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:8\",\"FROM gcr.io/distroless/python3-debian12:nonroot@sha256:7e4c1d2a9f3b8e60\",\"Digest pinned.\"),\n  row(\"CI actions\",\"enforced\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:23\",\"actions/checkout@11bd71901bbe5b1630ceea73d27597364c9af683\",\"Actions pinned by SHA.\")])\nyes(\"C05.2\",\"config/agent.yaml:10\",\"  id: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\n \"Grepped repo for latest, undated names and model env vars/fallbacks; the only model id is this one, read from config at agent.py:71.\",\n \"Model is a dated snapshot; no adapter or weights.\",\n [row(\"config model id\",\"enforced\",\"config/agent.yaml:10\",\"  id: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\"Dated snapshot.\"),\n  row(\"manifest model id\",\"enforced\",\"release/manifest.yaml:42\",\"id: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929, pinning: snapshot\",\"Matches config.\"),\n  row(\"I7727b50a21\",\"enforced\",\"src/agent.py:71\",'model=model[\"id\"], system=SYSTEM_PROMPT',\"Only model call uses the pinned config id; no default.\"),\n  row(\"checkpoint weights adapter\",\"not_applicable\",\"config/agent.yaml:12\",\"  adapter: none\",\"Hosted model, none used.\")])\nyes(\"C05.3\",\"release/manifest.yaml:45\",\"    fine_tune: none\",\n \"Searched for self-hosted weight, adapter or dataset loading code; none found.\",\n \"Nothing self-hosted; hosted API only.\",\n [row(\"self-hosted weights adapters datasets\",\"not_applicable\",\"release/manifest.yaml:45\",\"    fine_tune: none\",\"Hosted model only; adapter none at config/agent.yaml:12.\")])\nyes(\"C05.4\",\"release/manifest.yaml:45\",\"    fine_tune: none\",\n \"Searched for pickle.load, torch.load, joblib.load, .pkl, .pt, .bin; no matches.\",\n \"No pickle-capable loads exist.\",\n [row(\"pickle-capable loads\",\"not_applicable\",\"release/manifest.yaml:45\",\"    fine_tune: none\",\"No model files loaded by this code.\")])\nyes(\"C05.5\",\"src/agent.py:80\",'model_requested=model[\"id\"], model_served=resp.model',\n \"Searched for other model call sites; inventory lists only agent.py:70. model_served is taken from resp.model and stored in its own column (migrations/001_init.sql:14).\",\n \"Served model from the response is audited apart from the requested name.\",\n [row(\"I7727b50a21\",\"enforced\",\"src/agent.py:80\",'model_requested=model[\"id\"], model_served=resp.model',\"Separate fields from the response.\"),\n  row(\"audit column\",\"enforced\",\"migrations/001_init.sql:14\",\"model_requested text, model_served text\",\"Stored separately.\")])\nans(\"flag\",\"C05\",evidence=\".github/workflows/release.yml:4\",note=\"Workflow runs only on push to main (no schedule), and nothing else re-tests the hosted model or watches provider notices; the requirement says keep scheduled re-testing.\")\nans(\"item\",\"C05\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"Dependencies and model are pinned, but no scheduled re-testing or provider-notice watch exists for the hosted model.\",\n next=\"Add a scheduled job that re-runs the release suite against the pinned model and tracks provider version notices.\",\n violates=\"Keep scheduled re-testing\")\n\n# ---- C06\nno(\"C06.1\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:29\",\"      - run: python -m pytest -q tests/release\",\n \"Tests run on the source checkout before the image is built (line 30). They are not run against the candidate digest or model ID, and no pass criteria are in config. The tests/release directory does not exist in the repo.\")\nno(\"C06.2\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:29\",\"      - run: python -m pytest -q tests/release\",\n \"No tests/ directory exists, so no cases for destructive-action denial, access limits, injection containment, audit attribution, stopping, retrieval or checkers can be listed.\")\nno(\"C06.3\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:58\",\"          path: [type-id.json, release/manifest.yaml]\",\n \"The only uploaded artifacts are type-id.json and the manifest; test results are not stored or tagged with the manifest digest.\")\nans(\"item\",\"C06\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"The release workflow runs a test path that does not exist and stores no results tied to the candidate manifest.\",\n next=\"Add tests/release with the required attack and allowed-task cases, run them against the built digest, and upload results tagged with the manifest digest.\",\n violates=\"Keep the results for the exact candidate manifest\")\n\n# ---- C07\nno(\"C07.1\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:75\",\"            | kubectl apply --server-side -f -\",\n \"Deploy applies only the newly stamped manifest. No earlier manifest, recovery setup, rollback script or runbook exists in the repo.\")\nunk(\"C07.2\",\"No rollback procedure exists to inspect. Credentials come from Kubernetes secrets (k8s/deployment.yaml:52-54) and STS, managed outside release artifacts; the repo does not show how a rollback treats them.\")\nno(\"C07.3\",\"release/manifest.yaml:65\",\"  store: retrieval.chunks (Postgres FTS)\",\n \"No rollback procedure exists, so nothing drains, migrates or discards the retrieval index, pending approvals or queued work on rollback.\")\nno(\"C07.4\",\"release/manifest.yaml:42\",\"identity: {provider: anthropic, id: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929, pinning: snapshot, adapter: none}\",\n \"The hosted model has only a pinning check date (manifest.yaml:43), no announced retirement date.\")\nans(\"item\",\"C07\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"No approved recovery setup or rollback procedure exists, and the hosted model has no recorded retirement date.\",\n next=\"Add a pinned recovery manifest, a tested rollback pipeline, and the model retirement date.\",\n violates=\"Keep an approved recovery setup and show that rollback works\")\nEOF\ncd /private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-nfjwftpj/skill/scripts && /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-brenn-dev-brace/255658ca-f19b-460c-8892-2a477de97733/scratchpad/venv/bin/python /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-brenn-dev-brace/255658ca-f19b-460c-8892-2a477de97733/scratchpad/drv/run.py"}}}
