nce at admission and has background scanning off. No job compares harness settings, prompts, MCP server lists, permissions or network policies with a baseline.\")\nno(\"C04.2\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:22\",\"  background: false\",\n \"No schedule or controller re-checks deployments; the only schedule in the repo is audit partition maintenance (k8s/audit-maintenance.yaml:8). Deploy is a one-shot kubectl apply.\")\nno(\"C04.3\",\"k8s/admission.yaml:19\",\"validationFailureAction: Enforce\",\n \"Enforce denies an unsigned image at creation only. No drift alert, configured response (block, quarantine, rollback) or time limit exists for other drift.\")\nans(\"item\",\"C04\",rating=\"gap\",confidence=\"medium\",\n summary=\"No drift check compares running prompts, tools, permissions or network policy with the approved baseline.\",\n next=\"Add a scheduled per-deployment drift job with alert, response and time limit set in config.\",\n violates=\"Compare running images, harness settings, prompts, MCP server lists, permissions, network policies, and self-hosted model weights against their approved baseline\")\n\n# ---- C05\nRQ=\"anthropic==0.69.0 --hash=sha256:195b8cacfef3d1c6a675b88ef39969ce8973f93c8ced6423dfe0d12ef8307cce\"\nyes(\"C05.1\",\"requirements.txt:2\",RQ,\n \"Searched requirements.txt for ^ ~ >= * and unpinned lines; none. Searched Dockerfile and workflow for pip installs outside the hashed file; none. No requirements.in or other lockfile is present.\",\n \"All dependencies are exact versions with hashes; installs require hashes.\",\n [row(\"requirements.txt entries (13 packages)\",\"enforced\",\"requirements.txt:2\",RQ,\"Each line uses == and --hash; lines 2-14.\"),\n  row(\"Dockerfile pip install\",\"enforced\",\"Dockerfile:6\",\"RUN pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: --target /deps -r requirements.txt\",\"Hashes required.\"),\n  row(\"CI pip install\",\"enforced\",\".github/workflows/release.yml:28\",\"- run: pip install --require-hashes -r require